<title>USA: CBOE, AMEX to list CompUSA LEAPS.</title>
<headline>CBOE, AMEX to list CompUSA LEAPS.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board Options Exchange and American Stock Exchange said they would list long-term equity anticipation securities (LEAPS) on CompUSA Inc shares on June 4.</p>
<p>The LEAPS, which basically are long-term options, will have initial strike prices of 20, 22-1/2 and 25, with expirations in January 1999 (VZP) and January 2000 (LZP).</p>
<p>Chicago Derivatives Desk ((312-408-8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
